[05.04.2025]
v0.96.19
	The separate mapping of 2 joysticks is fully completed and tested.
	The "8bit Kempston" option has been added to the joystick menu. 
	It enables the mode of transferring all joystick buttons to emulation. 
	To exit this mode, press the combination START+SELECT

