[05/19/2023]
v0.43
Connecting the LCD Screen to the murmulator
	(3.2 inches, can be ordered here: https://www.aliexpress.com/item/33015586094.html)
	(LCD)	->		(PICO)
	SCK				17 (TFT_CLK_PIN)
	SDI(MOSI)		18 (TFT_DATA_PIN)
	RESET			19 (TFT_RST_PIN)
	DC				20 (TFT_DC_PIN)
	CS				21 (TFT_CS_PIN)
	VCC				VOut (+5v)
	GND				GND
	LED 3v3 (can be connected for a short time, for constant use it is necessary to select a resistor)

